== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Sol|Sol]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* "Sol" is the word for "[[Wikipedia:sun|sun]]" in Latin and some of its descendant languages, and is sometimes used to distinguish the Sun of the Solar System from other stars.
* The item's pick up quote might be a reference to ''DotA'''s Radiant team win end screen message.

